* Never shows name or levels in Level Select, except to show current level.
* All levels start locked, regardless of list position nothing will auto advance to levels in this list. Levels in this list have no auto advance target.
* Levels can still be played and completed if the player is manually sent there."
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 12
text = "This List is Always Hidden"

